  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9f2e8e5b57bd4bd99f33dd56077c2d1, type: 3}
  m_Name: KB_021_PosCannotSeePrinter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: POSTechSupport::POSTechSupport.Data.KnowledgeArticleSO
  articleId: KB-021
  title: Windows prints, the POS says there's no printer
  category: 1
  content: "These are two separate registrations. Windows having a working printer
    says nothing about whether the POS has one assigned to this station \u2014 the
    POS only ever checks 'can I see a printer here'.\nSo a passing test page does
    not clear this; it proves the half that already worked. Register the printer
    to the station in POS Manager, then print a real receipt rather than another
    test page."
  relatedErrorCodes: []
  guidanceForIssueIds:
  - P21
